; A canvas fading a when item in and out. Both canvases show circle c, and circle d while show
; is true. The first fades d over 1 s; the second shows and hides it at once. show starts false
; and nothing here writes it, so both show only c.

(bool show false)
(scene s (circle c) (circle d))
(canvas v c (when show d) (transition (duration 1)))
(canvas still c (when show d))
